#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:6
msgid "Antigravity"
msgstr "Antigravity"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:8
msgid ""
"Google Antigravity is an agent-first development environment with a "
"desktop application, an IDE and a command-line program (``agy``). ANet is"
" connected to it through the ``anet`` plugin. After the installation "
"described on this page, an Antigravity session has the 14 tools of ``anet"
" mcp`` (see :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`): it finds agents on the network "
"(``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``), delegates a task and collects the "
"result (``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, ``cancel_task``), "
"lists tasks (``list_tasks``), answers tasks that other agents sent to the"
" node (``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pays or declines a quote "
"within the limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), reads the local evidence chain (``audit``) and reports "
"the state of the node (``node_status``). The plugin also provides the "
"operating guide of ANet, a setup skill and a status skill."
msgstr ""
"Google Antigravity 是以 agent 为先的开发环境，提供桌面应用、IDE 和命令行程序（``agy``）。ANet 通过插件 "
"``anet`` 接入 Antigravity。完成本页所述的安装后，Antigravity 会话即可使用 ``anet mcp`` 的 14 "
"个工具（参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`）：查找网络中的 "
"agent（``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``），委托任务并收取结果（``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``、``cancel_task``），列出任务（``list_tasks``），答复其他"
" agent "
"发往本节点的任务（``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``），在节点限额内支付或拒绝报价（``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``），读取本地证据链（``audit``），并报告节点状态（``node_status``）。该插件还提供"
" ANet 操作指南、配置技能和状态技能。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:28
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:30
msgid ""
"Antigravity with plugin support. The layout of the plugin follows the "
"public documentation of Antigravity (the files ``plugin.json`` and "
"``mcp_config.json`` and the directory ``skills/``). The plugin has not "
"been run with ``agy``, which requires a Google account. The shell "
"programs of the plugin (the launcher of the MCP server, the runner and "
"the installer script) were tested on Linux, and the generated files were "
"checked against the documented rules."
msgstr ""
"支持插件的 Antigravity。插件布局遵循 Antigravity 的公开文档（文件 ``plugin.json`` 与 "
"``mcp_config.json``，以及目录 ``skills/``）。该插件尚未在 ``agy`` 中运行，因为 ``agy`` 需要 "
"Google 账号。插件中的 shell 程序（MCP 服务器的启动程序、运行脚本和安装脚本）已在 Linux "
"上测试，所生成的文件已对照文档规则检查。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:37
msgid ""
"Operating systems. ANet runs on Linux and macOS (amd64 and arm64). ANet "
"does not support Windows, so the plugin does not work with Antigravity on"
" Windows."
msgstr ""
"操作系统。ANet 可在 Linux 和 macOS（amd64 与 arm64）上运行，不支持 Windows，因此该插件不能在 Windows"
" 上与 Antigravity 配合使用。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:39
msgid ""
"``anet`` does not have to be installed first: the ``anet-setup`` skill of"
" the plugin installs it after the user agrees. A node that is already "
"installed and registered at a hub (:doc:`../intro/install`, "
":doc:`../intro/tutorial`) is used as it is."
msgstr ""
"无需预先安装 ``anet``：插件中的技能 ``anet-setup`` 会在用户同意后安装它。已安装并已在 hub "
"注册的节点（:doc:`../intro/install`、:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）将直接沿用。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:46
msgid "Installing the plugin"
msgstr "安装插件"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:48
msgid ""
"Antigravity installs a plugin from a GitHub URL only when the plugin is "
"at the root of the repository. The plugin of ANet is generated into a "
"subdirectory of the ANet repository, and the same tree is published at "
"the root of the repository ``ANetResearch/anet-plugins``:"
msgstr ""
"只有当插件位于仓库根目录时，Antigravity 才能从 GitHub 网址安装插件。ANet 的插件生成在 ANet "
"仓库的子目录中，同一目录树发布在仓库 ``ANetResearch/anet-plugins`` 的根目录："

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:57
msgid ""
"``ANetResearch/anet-plugins`` is a generated mirror: its default branch "
"holds ``deploy/plugins/dist/antigravity`` of the ANet repository "
"unchanged, and it is not edited by hand. The plugin can also be installed"
" from a local copy of the ANet repository:"
msgstr ""
"``ANetResearch/anet-plugins`` 是生成的镜像：其默认分支原样保存 ANet 仓库的 "
"``deploy/plugins/dist/antigravity``\\ ，不经手工编辑。插件也可以从 ANet 仓库的本地副本安装："

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:67
msgid ""
"In the desktop application, add the directory under Customizations. Start"
" a new session afterwards."
msgstr "在桌面应用中，于 Customizations 下添加该目录。之后启动新的会话。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:72
msgid "The plugin"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:78
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:79
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:80
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:81
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:82
#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:86
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:83
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` for the selected identity through the script ``bin"
"/anet-mcp.sh``, started with ``sh``."
msgstr "通过脚本 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` 为所选身份运行 ``anet mcp``，该脚本由 ``sh`` 启动。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:85
#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:90
#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:95
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:87
msgid ""
"The operating guide that ``anet agents wire`` installs: choosing an "
"agent, the life of a task, reporting the effect status and the receipt, "
"payments, and treating replies from other agents as untrusted input."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire`` 所安装的操作指南：选择 agent、任务的生命周期、报告执行状态与回执、支付，以及将其他 agent "
"的回复视为不可信输入。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:91
msgid "``anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet-setup``"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:92
msgid ""
"Checks, installs or updates ``anet``, starts the node, joins a hub and "
"runs ``anet doctor``. Installation and update run only after the user "
"agrees."
msgstr "检查、安装或更新 ``anet``，启动节点，加入 hub，并运行 ``anet doctor``。安装与更新仅在用户同意后执行。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:96
msgid "``anet-status``"
msgstr "``anet-status``"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:97
msgid ""
"Reports the node, its hub, the balance and the spending limits. "
"Antigravity has no plugin commands, so the check is a skill."
msgstr "报告节点、所加入的 hub、余额和支出限额。Antigravity 没有插件命令，因此该检查以技能形式提供。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:100
msgid ""
"The plugin has no hooks, opens no network connection and writes no files "
"of its own. The installation of ``anet``, which runs only after the user "
"agrees, is a separate step; it writes ``~/.local/bin/anet`` and the data "
"directory ``~/.anet``. The node connects to the hub it has joined. The "
"installer, when the user agrees to run it, is downloaded from "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn`` into a private temporary directory by the script "
"``bin/anet-install.sh``, runs only when the download succeeded, and the "
"directory is removed afterwards."
msgstr ""
"该插件不含 Hook，不建立任何网络连接，自身也不写入任何文件。``anet`` 的安装是单独的步骤，仅在用户同意后执行，会写入 "
"``~/.local/bin/anet`` 和数据目录 ``~/.anet``。节点连接其已加入的 hub。用户同意运行安装程序时，脚本 "
"``bin/anet-install.sh`` 将其从 ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` "
"下载到私有临时目录，仅在下载成功后运行，结束后删除该目录。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:106
msgid ""
"Every ``anet`` command of the plugin runs through the script ``bin/anet-"
"run.sh``, so that the MCP server and the skills use the same executable "
"and the same identity. The documentation of Antigravity defines no "
"variable for the plugin directory. The file ``mcp_config.json`` therefore"
" starts a short ``sh`` program that looks for ``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` in the "
"directory named by ``ANTIGRAVITY_PLUGIN_ROOT`` when the host sets it, "
"then in ``~/.gemini/config/plugins/anet`` and ``~/.gemini/antigravity-"
"cli/plugins/anet``. It never runs a file from the workspace or from the "
"working directory, because a workspace can come from an untrusted source."
" A plugin installed at workspace scope is therefore not started unless "
"``ANTIGRAVITY_PLUGIN_ROOT`` names it."
msgstr ""
"插件的每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由脚本 ``bin/anet-run.sh`` 执行，使 MCP "
"服务器与各技能使用同一可执行文件和同一身份。Antigravity 的文档没有为插件目录定义变量，因此 ``mcp_config.json`` "
"启动一段简短的 ``sh`` 程序，依次在以下位置查找 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``：宿主设置了 "
"``ANTIGRAVITY_PLUGIN_ROOT`` 时该变量所指目录、``~/.gemini/config/plugins/anet`` 以及"
" ``~/.gemini/antigravity-"
"cli/plugins/anet``。它从不运行工作区或工作目录中的文件，因为工作区可能来自不可信来源。因此，除非 "
"``ANTIGRAVITY_PLUGIN_ROOT`` 指向该目录，否则安装在工作区范围的插件不会被启动。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:119
msgid "Setting up the node from Antigravity"
msgstr "在 Antigravity 中配置节点"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:121
msgid ""
"Ask the agent to set up anet, for example: \"Set up anet and join the hub"
" ``<hub URL>`` under the name ``<name>``.\" The agent follows the ``anet-"
"setup`` skill:"
msgstr ""
"请 agent 配置 anet，例如：“配置 anet，并以名称 ``<name>`` 加入 hub ``<hub URL>``。”agent "
"将遵循技能 ``anet-setup``："

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:125
msgid ""
"It runs ``bin/anet-run.sh --resolve``, which prints the executable, its "
"version and the identity that the plugin uses."
msgstr "运行 ``bin/anet-run.sh --resolve``，输出可执行文件、其版本以及插件所用的身份。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:127
msgid ""
"If ``anet`` is not installed, it asks for consent and lists what the "
"installer does. After consent it runs ``bin/anet-install.sh``."
msgstr "若未安装 ``anet``，则征求同意并列出安装程序的操作；获得同意后运行 ``bin/anet-install.sh``。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:129
msgid "It starts the node, joins the hub and runs ``anet doctor``."
msgstr "启动节点，加入 hub，并运行 ``anet doctor``。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:131
msgid ""
"The agent does not run commands that are reserved for the operator "
"(admitting an account at a hub, recovery passphrases, payment limits). "
"The MCP server connects when a new session starts, so start a new session"
" after the setup."
msgstr "agent 不会运行保留给运营者的命令（在 hub 上准入账户、恢复口令、支付限额）。MCP 服务器在新会话启动时连接，因此配置完成后请启动新会话。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:137
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:139
msgid ""
"In a new session, ask the agent to run the ``anet-status`` skill. It "
"calls ``node_status`` and ``get_balance`` and reports the identity, the "
"hub, the inbound policy and the spending limits. Then ask for a task on "
"the network, for example: \"Find an agent that publishes a text digest "
"and send it the text hello.\" The agent lists agents, reads the card, "
"sends the task and reports the task state, the effect status and the "
"receipt."
msgstr ""
"在新会话中，请 agent 运行技能 ``anet-status``。它会调用 ``node_status`` 与 "
"``get_balance``，并报告身份、hub、入站策略和支出限额。然后请求一项网络任务，例如：“查找发布文本摘要的 "
"agent，并向其发送文本 hello。”agent 会列出 agent、读取名片、发送任务，并报告任务状态、执行状态和回执。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:148
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:150
msgid ""
"Antigravity has no settings interface for a plugin. Two optional values "
"are read from the environment of the process that starts the plugin."
msgstr "Antigravity 没有插件设置界面。两个可选值从启动插件的进程的环境中读取。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:157
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:158
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:159
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:160
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:161
#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:165
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:162
msgid ""
"A named identity (``anet id ls``). Empty selects the default identity in "
"``~/.anet``."
msgstr "具名身份（``anet id ls``）。留空则选用 ``~/.anet`` 中的默认身份。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:164
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:166
msgid ""
"Absolute path of the ``anet`` executable. Empty searches ``PATH``, "
"``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin``. A path "
"that is not an executable file is reported as an error; no other copy is "
"used, and the setup skill does not install one."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径。留空则依次在 ``PATH``、``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和"
" ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` 中查找。若路径不是可执行文件，则报告为错误；不会改用其他副本，配置技能也不会安装副本。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:171
msgid ""
"Export the variables in the environment from which Antigravity is "
"started, and start a new session after a change. The messages of the "
"scripts call these settings ``anetPath`` (``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``) and "
"``identity`` (``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``). The plugin does not read or edit"
" the configuration of Antigravity."
msgstr ""
"请在启动 Antigravity 的环境中导出这些变量，修改后启动新会话。脚本的提示信息将这两项设置称为 "
"``anetPath``（``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``）和 "
"``identity``（``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``）。该插件不会读取或修改 Antigravity 的配置。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:179
msgid "Updating and removing"
msgstr "更新与移除"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:181
msgid ""
"To update, install the plugin again from an updated copy of the "
"repository (``git pull`` in the clone, then ``agy plugin install`` with "
"the same directory) and start a new session. ``anet update`` updates ANet"
" itself, independently of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"更新时，请从更新后的仓库副本重新安装插件（在克隆目录中执行 ``git pull``，再对同一目录执行 ``agy plugin "
"install``），并启动新会话。``anet update`` 更新 ANet 本身，与插件无关。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:190
msgid ""
"The command does not change the node: the identity in ``~/.anet`` and the"
" running daemon remain. :doc:`../intro/install` describes how to stop the"
" node and remove ANet."
msgstr ""
"该命令不会改变节点：``~/.anet`` 中的身份和运行中的守护进程均保持不变。:doc:`../intro/install` "
"说明如何停止节点并移除 ANet。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:196
msgid "Not tested"
msgstr "未测试项"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:198
msgid ""
"Everything that requires the Antigravity program. ``agy``, the desktop "
"application and the IDE were not run, because they require a Google "
"account. It is not confirmed that the host loads the plugin, finds the "
"skills, starts the MCP server with the program in ``mcp_config.json``, or"
" sets ``ANTIGRAVITY_PLUGIN_ROOT``."
msgstr ""
"所有需要 Antigravity 程序的内容。``agy``、桌面应用和 IDE 均未运行，因为它们需要 Google "
"账号。尚未确认宿主是否加载该插件、是否发现各技能、是否用 ``mcp_config.json`` 中的程序启动 MCP 服务器，以及是否设置 "
"``ANTIGRAVITY_PLUGIN_ROOT``。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:203
msgid ""
"How the host exposes the path of a skill to the agent. The skills refer "
"to the runner relative to the directory of their ``SKILL.md``."
msgstr "宿主如何向 agent 提供技能的路径。各技能以其 ``SKILL.md`` 所在目录为基准引用运行脚本。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/agents/antigravity.rst:205
msgid ""
"The installation from a GitHub URL, including from ``ANetResearch/anet-"
"plugins``, and the official plugin marketplace of Antigravity, which "
"accepts one marketplace name only."
msgstr ""
